   730                              <1> ; ApplyRowSweep: Target a horizontal row (DH = row)
   731                              <1> ; Logic: Iterates through row * width to (row + 1) * width - 1.
   732                              <1> ; If cell is mine, set to TILE_FLAGGED; otherwise set to TILE_REVEALED.
   733                              <1> ApplyRowSweep:
   734 00003372 60                  <1>     pusha
