     2                              <1> ; Screen composition
     3                              <1> ;
     4                              <1> ; Text in mode 13h goes through PrintAt (video.asm), which paints each
     5                              <1> ; cell's background from [TextBg]: 0FFh (the default) repaints the
     6                              <1> ; sidebar gradient, any other value is a solid colour.  Routines that
     7                              <1> ; print onto a panel or dialog set [TextBg] first and put 0FFh back
     8                              <1> ; when they are done.
